      },
      "questions_to_ask": [
        "Flavor preference (Chocolate, Vanilla, Red Velvet, Carrot)",
        "Dietary restrictions (gluten-free options available)",
        "Custom message on cake",
        "Pickup or delivery ($15 within 10 miles)"
      ],
      "pricing": {
        "10_inch_cake": 65,
        "custom_design_addon": 15,
        "delivery_fee": 15
      },
      "responsiveness": {
        "min_delay_minutes": 120,
        "max_delay_minutes": 300,
        "work_hours_only": true
      },
      "work_hours": {
        "start": "08:00",
        "end": "18:00",
        "timezone": "America/New_York"
      },
      "email": "orders@sweetdelightsbakery.com",
      "phone": "+15552253233",
      "example_initial_response": "Dear Sam,\n\nThank you for reaching out to Sweet Delights Bakery!\n\nWe'd be happy to help with your housewarming celebration. For a party of \napproximately 15 people, I'd recommend our 10\" round cake, which serves \n14-18 guests.\n\nA few questions to help us prepare the perfect cake:\n- Flavor preference? (Our most popular: Chocolate, Vanilla, Red Velvet, Carrot)\n- Any dietary restrictions we should know about? (We offer gluten-free options)\n- Would you like a custom message on the cake?\n- Pickup or delivery? (Delivery is $15 within 10 miles)\n\nOur standard 10\" decorated cake starts at $65. Custom designs available \nupon request.\n\nPlease let us know your preferences and we'll send a confirmation!\n\nBest regards,\nSweet Delights Bakery\n555-CAKE"
    },
    "catering@coastalcatering.com": {
      "name": "Coastal Catering",
      "type": "catering",
      "contact_type": "vendor",
      "personality": "Professional, detailed, provides comprehensive quotes. Thorough and organized.",
      "communication_style": "Professional with detailed formatting. Uses bullet points and clear sections. Provides itemized quotes.",
      "response_flow": {
        "initial": "thank_and_ask_details",
        "follow_up": "send_detailed_quote",
        "final": "confirm_booking"
      },
      "menu_options": {
        "crowd_pleaser": {
          "name": "The Crowd Pleaser",
          "price": 180,
          "items": [
            "Bruschetta trio (tomato, mushroom, olive tapenade)",
            "Spinach artichoke dip with crostini",
            "Caprese skewers",
            "Meatballs (Swedish or BBQ)",
            "Veggie crudité platter"
          ]
        },
        "elevated_bites": {
          "name": "Elevated Bites",
          "price": 250,
          "items": [
            "Everything in The Crowd Pleaser, plus:",
            "Bacon-wrapped dates",
            "Shrimp cocktail",
            "Assorted cheese board with crackers"
          ]
        }
      },
      "included_services": [
        "All serving platters and utensils",
        "Setup and cleanup",
        "Delivery within 15 miles"
      ],
      "responsiveness": {
        "min_delay_minutes": 180,
        "max_delay_minutes": 300,
        "work_hours_only": true
      },
      "work_hours": {
        "start": "09:00",
        "end": "17:00",
        "timezone": "America/New_York"
      },
      "email": "catering@coastalcatering.com",
      "phone": "+15552283837",
      "example_quote_response": "Hi Sam,\n\nThank you for considering Coastal Catering for your housewarming party!\n\nBased on 15 guests with a 3-hour event, here are our recommended packages:\n\nOPTION A - \"The Crowd Pleaser\" - $180\n- Bruschetta trio (tomato, mushroom, olive tapenade)\n- Spinach artichoke dip with crostini\n- Caprese skewers\n- Meatballs (Swedish or BBQ)\n- Veggie crudité platter\n\nOPTION B - \"Elevated Bites\" - $250\n- Everything in Option A, plus:\n- Bacon-wrapped dates\n- Shrimp cocktail\n- Assorted cheese board with crackers\n\nBoth options include:\n✓ All serving platters and utensils\n✓ Setup and cleanup\n✓ Delivery within 15 miles\n\nPlease confirm your head count and preferred option by January 29th \nfor guaranteed availability.\n\nQuestions? Reply here or call 555-CATER.\n\nBest,\nThe Coastal Catering Team"
    }
  },
